<div class="container prose">
  <p>Municipal water in the Houston region is safe to drink but can still carry hardness, chlorine taste, and sediment that wear fixtures and appliances. We install and service point-of-entry softeners, carbon filtration, reverse-osmosis drinking systems, and salt-free conditioners where they make sense.</p>
  <h2>How we help</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Testing and sizing based on household use and pipe size</li>
    <li>Metered softeners to cut salt waste</li>
    <li>RO faucets at the kitchen for cooking and bottles</li>
    <li>Maintenance reminders for cartridge and membrane swaps</li>
  </ul>
